# Build context trimming. The three Dockerfiles COPY only what they need
# (server/, packages/, pnpm workspace files, dash/ or panel/, deploy/*), so
# everything else only slows the context upload. Patterns are .gitignore
# style: a bare name matches at any depth.
#
# Kept out of the context:
#   bin/            55MB of local build output (make build)
#   node_modules/   dash/ panel/ docs/ all reinstall inside the build stage
#   .env            holds secrets; never needed by any build stage
#   docs 内容        only docs/package.json is COPYed (workspace install)
#   .git / 文档 /   metadata and prose, no build dependency

.git
bin
node_modules
dist
.vite
.env
*.log
*.db
*.db-shm
*.db-wal
*.coverprofile
profile.cov
server/ferry
.github
Makefile
README.md
README.zh.md
todo.md
THIRD_PARTY.md
docs/.vitepress
docs/guide
docs/design
docs/deploy
docs/public
docs/*.md
